# The server accepts STARTTLS, reads the client's first message of the
# handshake and closes the connection without an answer, so that the
# client sees the stream end where starttls-dropped has it see a reset.
# Either way a connection lost in the handshake may be there the next time:
# Deferred.
mode=starttls-eof
tls=starttls-ca
form=(From=alice@example.com To=bob@example.net Subject=Hello Body=$'Secret\n' User=alice Password=secret)
